  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Chris Sawin",
      "content": "Mobile Suit Gundam: Hathaway has some hiccups, but ultimately shows promise with its action sequences. But Mobile Suit Gundam: The Sorcery of Nymph Circe is so dull, feels tortuously long, and all of the characters are selfish a-holes. The sequel feels uneventful, and its strange use of almost absolute darkness and bizarre montages only sours the fact that you could be watching mobile suits pound each other stupid in the sky instead.\r\n\r\nhttps://bit.ly/Gundammit",
      "rating": 4,
      "createdAt": "2026-05-14T20:38:34Z"
    }
  ],
